# Mobbin-first UI

Any frontend or UI change (report HTML, `enact ui`, Pages landing, or other user-facing layout) must cite [Mobbin](https://mobbin.com) design references on the PRD and the slice. Put the links in the **Design references** field.

If those fields are empty, **stop**. Do not invent a visual design. A human supplies Mobbin links before UI work continues.

PRs that change UI include those citations plus before/after screenshots. The HTML report stays a single offline file. No new fonts, CDNs, or analytics.
